# Slice 3 · First Real AI · Invoice Extraction End-to-End

*Restructure to monorepo · FastAPI + Postgres · ONE prompt (invoice_extractor v1) · upload-to-extracted in ~10s · stop mocking invoices*

---

## Why

Slices 1 and 2 prove the UX. This slice proves the AI works on a real document.
Pick the narrowest path that closes the loop: text upload → invoice_extractor v1 → fields visible in inbox.
Everything else (classifier, summary, contracts, RAG, OCR, PDF) stays mocked or deferred.

The win: paste a real Romanian invoice text, watch fields populate, see no hallucinated amounts.
That's the moment the product becomes credible to a Romanian SME owner instead of just looking credible.

---

## Scope

```
IN     repo restructure       apps/web (move existing SvelteKit) · apps/api (new) · infra/
       infra/                  docker-compose.yml (postgres only) · .env.example
       FastAPI                 pyproject.toml · app/ structure per stack pack §3
       database                postgres (no pgvector yet — defer to slice-5 when RAG)
                               SQLAlchemy + Alembic
                               4 tables: documents · document_analyses · audit_events · prompt_runs
       endpoints               POST   /api/documents          multipart .txt + type selector
                               GET    /api/documents          list
                               GET    /api/documents/:id      detail (with analysis + audit)
                               POST   /api/documents/:id/approve
                               GET    /api/audit              recent events
                               GET    /api/health             liveness
       provider adapter        OpenAI-compatible client · env-configurable
                                 LLM_API_BASE_URL · LLM_API_KEY · LLM_MODEL
       analyzer framework      pluggable Analyzer protocol · registry · pipeline dispatches by doc.type
                               slice-3 ships ONE registered analyzer (InvoiceExtractor)
                               slice-4+ adds new analyzers as new files · no pipeline refactor
       prompt                  invoice_extractor v1 · template file under apps/api/app/prompts/
                               first line MUST be: # prompt: invoice_extractor v1
                               output validated against Pydantic InvoiceExtraction schema
       pipeline                upload → save document row → BackgroundTask:
                                 for analyzer in analyzers_for(doc):
                                   call analyzer.run(doc) → merge result into DocumentAnalysis +
                                   record PromptRun + append AuditEvent
       frontend wiring         /app/inbox loads from GET /api/documents (loading/empty/error states)
                               upload UI: textarea + filename + type selector + Submit
                               show "Live" badge on real-extracted docs vs none on others
       seed script             apps/api/scripts/seed_invoices.py
                                 uploads the 4 existing invoice rawContent strings as type=supplier_invoice
                                 use ONLY content already in src/lib/data/inbox.ts (don't re-author)

OUT    classifier prompt        slice-4
       summary prompt           slice-4
       contract review prompt   slice-4
       PDF parsing              slice-4
       OCR                      slice-5
       pgvector + embeddings    slice-5
       Ask My Company real      slice-5 (qa.ts mocks remain)
       Draft Reply real         slice-5 (replies.ts mocks remain)
       authentication           post-MVP
       multi-tenant / users     post-MVP
       evaluation harness       slice-4
       Celery / Redis           when retry or long jobs · not yet
       MinIO                    when local FS hurts · not yet
       LiteLLM                  when 2+ providers · not yet
```

